  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Windham, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t\t All Residents \r\n\t\t\t\t Duplicate Copy of a Registration \r\n\t\t\t\t New Residents Relocating From Out-of-State \r\n\t\t\t\t New Hampshire Residents Relocating to Windham \r\n\t\t\t\t Plate Changes \r\n\t\t\t\t Process a Vehicle Registration Online \r\n\t\t\t Boat Registrations \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Town Clerk FAQs \r\n\t\t\t Driver Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Election & Voter Information \r\n\t\t\t\t Absentee Voters \r\n\t\t\t\t Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Voter Information \r\n\t\t\t Fishing and Boat Access Keys \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Notary Services \r\n\t\t\t Public Records \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Inspections \r\n\t\t\t Vital Statistics Records \r\n\t\t\t Title Application \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nCandis J. Johnson \r\nTown Clerk - Town Hall \r\nTown Clerk \r\nTownClerk@WindhamNH.Gov \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Mailing Address \n\t\t\t\t\t 3 N. Lowell Rd \n\t\t\t\t\t Windham ,  NH   03087 \r\nPhone:  603-434-5075 \r\nFax: 603-965-1275 \r\nOur hours of operation are Monday-Friday 8am-4pm.  To avoid long in-person wait times, we encourage you to utilize our online services.  Thank you. \r\nWindham's Top Dog for 2026 is Luna!!! \nAll dogs aged 4-months or older must be licensed annually by April 30th. Please provide a current rabies certificate when securing a dog license. (RSA 466:1) \n2026 Dog License Fees  \nPuppies and Altered Dogs: $7.50 \nUnaltered Dogs: $10.00 \nSeniors (age 65+) First Dog: $3.00 \nDuplicate or Replacement Tag: $1.50 \nConstruction Vehicles - please email the vehicle information to  townclerk@windhamnh.gov  prior to coming in to register. \nMotorhome Registrations -   Please call to make an appointment to register your motorhome. Thank you. 603-434-5075 \nMarriage Licenses require an appointment. Please e-mail  townclerk@windhamnh.gov  to schedule an appointment. \nIf you are new to Windham, you must be added to the Town Census. Please call the office prior to coming in to find out what documents you need to bring. Being added to the census takes time, we ask that you arrive no later than 3:30 p.m. to start this process. Thank you! \r\nNotarized Letter of Residency (Windham Town Census) \r\n9 \n1 \n1 \n2 \t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Vehicle Registration \r\nDiscover details regarding how anyone can register a vehicle in Windham. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Boat Registrations \r\nAny motorized boat operated on the public waters of New Hampshire, including tidal and coastal waters and all inland waters, must be registered and must display the bow number issued by the Department of Motor Vehicles. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\nResidents may renew their dog license(s) online. Please be prepared to provide your previous tag number and your bank information, and updated rabies information, if necessary. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Town Clerk FAQs \r\nDiscover frequently asked questions regarding the work of the Town Clerk. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Driver Licensing \r\nView details regarding obtaining a drivers license as a citizen in Windham. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Election & Voter Information \r\nDiscover information regarding the election process in Windham and in addition take a look at election results for the community. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Fishing and Boat Access Keys \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Marriage Licensing \r\nIf applying for your license in the State of New Hampshire, you may go to any Town Clerk’s office. It doesn’t matter where you’re getting married. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Notary Services \r\nThe Town Clerk's Office offers free Notary Services during normal business hours. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Public Records \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Vehicle Inspections \r\nAll New Hampshire registered vehicles require a safety inspection to be conducted within 10 days of the registration. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Vital Statistics Records \r\nDiscover how to gain access to vital records in Windham such as birth, death, marriage, and divorce certificates. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Title Application \r\nFind out the process for applying for a Title in the State of New Hampshire \r\nEvents Calendar \r\nTue, Nov. 3   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t STATE GENERAL ELECTION - 2026 \r\n\t\t         View All Events \r\n/Calendar.aspx \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Vehicle Registration \r\n\t\t\t Building Permits \r\n\t\t\t Tax Assessments \r\n\t\t\t GIS Map & Property Info \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Windham \r\n3 North Lowell Road \r\nWindham, NH 03087 \r\n(603) 965-1201 \r\nOld Values, New Horizons \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Accessibility \n         Privacy Policy \n         Copyright Notices \n         Sign In \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
